@startuml
title AWS IoT Device Simulator - System Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam arrowThickness 1
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

actor "Admin/Operator" as Admin
actor "API Client" as ApiClient
actor "AWS CloudFormation" as Cfn

component "Web Management Console" as Console

package "AWS (Regional)" as AWS {
  [Amazon API Gateway\nREST API\n(stage: prod,\nCORS + Validation,\nAccess Logs JSON,\nMethod Logging: INFO,\nTracing Enabled)] as APIGW
  component "AWS Lambda\nSimulation API" as LambdaApi
  component "AWS Lambda\nRoute Loader" as LambdaRoute
  component "AWS Lambda\nCustom Resource\n(Deployment-Time)" as LambdaCR
  database "Amazon DynamoDB\n(Config & State)" as DDB
  collections "Amazon S3\nROUTE_BUCKET\n(Route JSON)" as S3
  component "AWS Step Functions\nSimulation Orchestration" as SFN
  queue "AWS IoT\nTopics" as IoT
  component "Identity Service\n(e.g., Cognito)" as Auth
  component "Logging & Tracing\n(CloudWatch Logs, X-Ray)" as Logs
}

' Users and Clients
Admin --> Console
Console --> APIGW : HTTPS
ApiClient --> APIGW : HTTPS

' AuthN
Console ..> Auth : authenticate
APIGW ..> Auth : authorize

' API integrations
APIGW --> LambdaApi : Invoke
APIGW --> LambdaRoute : Route APIs

' Data and state
LambdaApi --> DDB : CRUD sim/device-type\nmetadata
LambdaApi --> SFN : Start/Manage\nsimulation

' Route loading
LambdaRoute --> S3 : Get route JSON\n(key=routeName OR\nroute-{id}.json)
LambdaRoute --> DDB : Update route state

' Simulation execution & messaging
SFN --> IoT : Publish simulated\nmessages

' Deployment-time custom resource
Cfn --> LambdaCR : Invoke on\nCreate/Update/Delete
LambdaCR --> Cfn : Send response\n(JSON body)

' Observability
APIGW --> Logs : Access logs\n(JSON)
APIGW ..> Logs : Tracing
LambdaApi --> Logs
LambdaRoute --> Logs
LambdaCR --> Logs
SFN --> Logs

note right of APIGW
Supports methods:
GET, POST, PUT,
DELETE, OPTIONS
end note

note bottom of LambdaRoute
Parses UTF-8 JSON routes,
assembles route state:
routeName, odometer,
routeStage, burndown,
burndownCalc, routeEnded,
route, randomTriggers.
Propagates S3 errors.
end note

@enduml